{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "2SA",
 "chapter": 2,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.1",
   "range": "2SA.2.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4262d950",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.1#p1-13a510a1",
     "text": "By means of the high priest, 1Sa 23:2, 2Sa 5:19.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "enquired of the LORD",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Sa 23:2, 2Sa 5:19",
       "ref": "1SA.23.2"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Sa 23:2, 2Sa 5:19",
       "ref": "2SA.5.19"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.1#p2-841cc04b",
     "text": "Which was also called Kirjatharba Jos 14:15.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "Hebron",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jos 14:15",
       "ref": "JOS.14.15"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.3",
   "range": "2SA.2.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fe103b45",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.3#p1-fe103b45",
     "text": "In the time of his persecution.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "him did David bring up"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.6",
   "range": "2SA.2.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "22accfea",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.6#p1-22accfea",
     "text": "According to his promise, which is to repay those who are merciful.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "truth unto you"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.7",
   "range": "2SA.2.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b5c8f18a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.7#p1-b5c8f18a",
     "text": "So that you shall not want a captain and a defender.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "king over them"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.9",
   "range": "2SA.2.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "e1ef4707",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.9#p1-e1ef4707",
     "text": "Over the eleven tribes.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "all Israel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.11",
   "range": "2SA.2.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f68fab6a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.11#p1-f68fab6a",
     "text": "After this he reigned over all the country 33 years, 2Sa 5:5.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "months",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 5:5",
       "ref": "2SA.5.5"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.14",
   "range": "2SA.2.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "01d54e5c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.14#p1-01d54e5c",
     "text": "Let us see how they can handle their weapons.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "play before us"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.16",
   "range": "2SA.2.16",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "ecc0b19d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.16#p1-ecc0b19d",
     "text": "Meaning his adversary.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "fellow by the head"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.17",
   "range": "2SA.2.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "23e9339c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.17#p1-23e9339c",
     "text": "After that these four and twenty were slain.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "before the servants of David"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.22",
   "range": "2SA.2.22",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "33ecff54",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.22#p1-33ecff54",
     "text": "Why do you provoke me to kill you?",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "wherefore should I smite thee to"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.23",
   "range": "2SA.2.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9d3998f5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.23#p1-9d3998f5",
     "text": "Some read, in those parts where the lively parts lie, the heart, lungs, liver, and gall bladder.",
     "label": "m",
     "anchor": "fifth rib"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.26",
   "range": "2SA.2.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "7d05ce58",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.26#p1-7d05ce58",
     "text": "Shall we not make an end of murdering?",
     "label": "n",
     "anchor": "sword devour for ever"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.27",
   "range": "2SA.2.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "08686992",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.27#p1-08686992",
     "text": "If you had not provoked them to battle, 2Sa 2:14.",
     "label": "o",
     "anchor": "spoken",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "2Sa 2:14",
       "ref": "2SA.2.14"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/2SA.2.31",
   "range": "2SA.2.31",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "94a9b65d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/2SA.2.31#p1-94a9b65d",
     "text": "Thus God would confirm David in his kingdom by the destruction of his adversaries.",
     "label": "p",
     "anchor": "hundred and threescore men died"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
